<title>UK: EIB sets 15 billion peseta 10-year matador bond.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 15 billion peseta 10-year matador bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following matador bond was announced by joint lead managers Banco Bilbao Vizcaya and J.P. Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    15 BLN PTA    COUPON     8.50	MATURITY    03.OCT.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.80    PAY DATE    03.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    MADRID    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    SPANISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.00	SELL CONC  0.875     PRAECIP     =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
